these needs, VCS provides the $vcdplusmsglog system task which is called
from SystemVerilog. This task can be applied in many contexts to record data directly into
the VPD file. The $vcdplusmsglog system task is based on the transaction abstraction.
The $vcdplusmsglog system task, is intended primarily for recording messages, notes,
and transactions. These transactions include definition, creation, and relationships on
multiple streams. $vcdplusmsglog forms the basis of transaction modeling and debug.
Transaction Debug in UCLI
Use the following UCLI commands for transaction level debugging:
msglog [-st[tream] <stream>]
[-sc[cope] <stream_scope>]
-type <_MSG_T>
[-n[ame] <msg_name>]
-sev[erity] <_MSG_S>
[-h[eader] <msg_header>]
[-b[ody] <msg_body>]
-r[elation] <_MSG_R>
[-relname <relation>]
[-target <target>]

