Disabling and Re-enabling Randomization
You can disable and re-enable randomization in an unpacked struct with the rand_mode()
method.
Example 83 Disabling and Re-enabling Randomization with the rand_mode() Method

rand integer i1;
} ST1;

rand ST1 st1;

repeat (10)
#10 $display("\n\t at %0t",$time);
end

#55 cc.rand_mode(0);
#20 cc.rand_mode(1);
