end

In Example 169, the 4-bit variable x is constrained to value 3 when the object handle a2 is
not null. The following is the result of the example:
x = 6 a1 = '{i:5} a2 = null
x = 1 a1 = '{i:5} a2 = null
x = 9 a1 = '{i:1} a2 = null
