• General addition and subtraction
• Nested concatenation expression
• State variables in concatenation expression
• Rand variables in concatenation expression
• Repetition expression in concatenation
• MDA(multi-dimension array) in concatenation expression
• Foreach with concatenation expression
• Inheritance class with concatenation expression
• Separate multi-classes with concatenation expression
• Dynamic array with concatenation expression
