For
array members
array members where objects are allocated before randomization, priorities are
assigned in increasing order by position in the array, where the soft constraints in element
N have lower priority than the soft constraints in element N+1.
For array members where the objects are allocated during randomization, all soft
constraints in allocated objects and their base classes and member classes have the
